{"server":"tw","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_04_beg","groupId":"act45side","stageId":"act45side_04","title":"名為客房區的迷宮","storyCode":"SS-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c25c04072a0f7f19de9fbbb30ceb5de03dd1134a860e4bcc78af87672f85693e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在初華的夢境中，祥子乘船前往了一座人煙稀少的小島，並發現初華在夢境中孤獨地等待了她許多年。另一邊，初華因為剛結識的朋友艾雅法拉的疑問，不得不正視自己的感情。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g10_dreamcastlestage"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g3_islandharbor"},{"type":"narration","text":"從搖搖晃晃的甲板走上堅硬的土地，重新腳踏實地的感覺讓祥子有些安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，謝謝你一直陪我聊天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座島離陸地實在太遠了，如果沒有你，我一個人盯著海面開船，肯定會無聊到發瘋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和您聊天，也讓我聽到了許多海上的趣事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的裝扮看起來也不像是本地人，怎麼會來這種無人問津的小島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……有一個想找的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是本地人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……應該不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是稀奇，這座島上只有往外面跑的，從來沒看過有人會主動來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我也不能確定她在不在這裡……"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子手中只有這張前往小島的船票，無論是不是莫菲絲的惡作劇，她都只有這一個選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拍肩）哎呀，沒關係啦！這座島上人這麼少，問一下住在這裡的居民，肯定很快就能找到的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過小姐，不管最後有沒有找到，你過了正午一定要回到這裡哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的航班實在太少了，如果錯過的話，至少要等下個月才能離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是現在已經快……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，這也沒辦法啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也能多等你一下，但晚上出航不安全，我們日落前一定要返航。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那我現在就出發！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（大聲）Do——Re——Mi——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，聽得到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）Do——Re——Mi——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛在遠處重複了一遍……這樣就聽不到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯，剛剛，沒有聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我先幫你把眼罩拿下來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不容樂觀……和上次比起來，又近了一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣嗎……我知道了。以後外出考察，我會多注意周圍狀況的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾雅法拉，你應該多為自己的安全著想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來島上有多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩個月前來到這裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的聽力一直在惡化，但這裡沒有專業的醫生可以幫你醫治。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天碼頭應該有航船停靠，我幫你收拾行李，你等一下就啟程回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，這裡的火山還有最後一組數據還沒收集完……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你的身體——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來這個小島前，我已經請羅德島的醫生幫我做了健康檢查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……情況的確不樂觀，但我答應醫生了，三個月內一定會回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生她知道火山研究對我來說很重要，所以最後還是同意讓我來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"初華小姐，我喜歡火山，就和你喜歡星星一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們初次的相遇，不就是那晚我在山上迷路，然後遇見了剛好在看星空的你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你之後去山上考察，記得找我一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒問題！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早晨的天氣真好啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"初華小姐，我能聽你唱首歌嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺這個天氣很適合邊聽歌，邊眺望遠處的火山和大海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那我靠近一點……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"初華稍微拉近了兩人的距離，她看見艾雅法拉小小的耳朵豎了起來，裡面的助聽器也露了出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深吸氣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“描繪扭曲天空，我不禁去遐想”\n“願無羽翼的你，墮臨至我身旁”\n“我不幸觸碰了，神聖高潔之物”\n“只求你在今夜，成為我的神話——”\n“……”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真好聽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這首歌是誰寫的？我好像在其他地方都沒有聽過，難道是島上的音樂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道。可能是以前聽過的某首歌吧，無意間就記住了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，初華小姐……你現在好像很悲傷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？三角初華？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"約翰，你聽說過這個名字嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"同樣疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒印象，這個名字一聽就知道是島外人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，可以請您再想想看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽附近的老奶奶說，您在島上的人緣最好，認識的人最多，肯定能提供一些線索……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……但是這座島上的人也不多，我們都沒聽說過的人，應該是新來的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，之前不是說火山的背面有棟別墅，裡面住著一個怪人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"同樣疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……好像是有這個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"同樣疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然想不起來叫什麼名字了，但感覺只有可能是她了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那她現在在哪裡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，沿著環島公路往北二十公里，繞到山的背面你就能看到那棟別墅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，二十公里，開車的話大概半小時……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這裡沒有車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有車？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"同樣不再疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才來的時候沒有注意到嗎？我們這座島上哪裡有車啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，明明道路都維護得很好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"那是以前想吸引島外人來旅遊嘛，沒想到建好後沒有人來，反而更窮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"小妹妹，如果你趕時間的話，這輛腳踏車借給你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然看起來有點舊，但還是可以用的。你騎快一點的話，差不多兩個小時就到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子看向了大叔身後那輛老舊的腳踏車，破破爛爛的車身，上面印著的圖案也已經斑駁殘破，一切似乎都在無聲地訴說著它飽經風霜的過往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"同樣不再疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加油！好久沒看到新面孔了，祝你順利找到那個人，還有祝你在島上玩得開心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你大叔！那我就先走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子輕輕踩下踏板——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這台車……只要能騎得動……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"小心一點，你前面是下坡路——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"提醒總是遲來一步，少女已經和老舊的腳踏車一起失控地衝了下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊————————！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再疑惑的島民","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"……很有趣吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實在是——太好笑了！哈哈哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃爾夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫、莫菲絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃爾夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，覺得，有點，過火……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃爾夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是她自己同意的賭局，我只是遵守我們之間的約定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定會找到她的弱點，然後為她編織一個永不醒來的夢境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她會明白的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是夢城堡最好的“造夢師”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……愛麗絲，那個傢伙，她不可能比我強。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g16_sunnyday_R1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太陽升到頭頂，樹蔭越來越少了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感覺慢慢開始變熱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的住處離這很近，不如去我那裡坐一下吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g6_noblelivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——真的一下子就變得涼快了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個客廳真的好大——這麼空曠的房間，冬天應該很冷吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"點燃那邊的壁爐，屋內很快就會變暖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我一個人的話，拿個小爐子放在沙發旁邊就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我沒想到你原來是大小姐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像誤會了什麼。我不是什麼大小姐，我只是這裡的管家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）我會不會吵到房子的主人……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係啦，現在這裡只有我一個人住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這棟房子的主人……已經很久沒回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來……你很想念她的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，比起主僕，我們的關係可能更特別一點……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是第一個把目光放在我身上的人，之後也成為了我的第一位摯友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她喜歡彈鋼琴，我就坐在旁邊的椅子上，為她伴唱和聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一開始，我們真的很開心……很開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，她為什麼會離開呢？離開這座小島，離開這個……“家”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼呢……難道說想留在這裡的，從來都只有我一個人嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"腳踏車的吱呀聲越來越刺耳，平衡也越來越難以控制。\n更糟糕的是，體力已經漸漸透支。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"急轉彎處，腳踏車突然失去了控制，祥子被慣性甩了出去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"強忍著疼痛，她支撐起身體，努力抬頭看向目的地。\n遙遠的山腳下，依稀能看見一棟房子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……"},{"type":"narration","text":"看著那棟房子，無數陌生的回憶莫名浮現在祥子的腦海中——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在初華的夢裡，小時候的祥子和初華在那裡玩耍。\n長大後，她們一起在那裡生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些……都是初華的夢嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼——♪哼哼哼——♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……怎麼樣？託我的福，你應該也能看到了吧？我的確幫她創造了很多美妙的夢，但這個叫初華的孩子，最大的願望就是跟你在一起呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是夢的最後，她都是獨自一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每次的結局都是你不受掌控，然後突然消失——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"豐川祥子，你還真是個殘酷的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……殘酷……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是聽那個傢伙說過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夢是人內心深處最真實的想法。而在三角初華的心裡——她越渴望和你在一起，就越無法觸及你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算創造了一個渺無人煙的小島，就算這裡只有你和她，她也只能一次又一次地體會獲得後又失去的痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她那小小的幸福，總會像流沙一樣從指尖溜走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，一個人的內心到底有多絕望，才會連夢境都無法挽救啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……初華，我會把你從惡夢裡拉出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？真的嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就期待一下——期待一下你無能為力、惱羞成怒的表情吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就在莫菲絲肆無忌憚地狂笑時，遠處傳來了一陣船舶的鳴笛。\n那是它即將返航的訊號。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
